{"id":"917498405","kind":"answer","title":"有什么独特的记忆方法？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"AnkiX高考","date":"2019-12-01","updated":"2019-12-01","votes":8,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":582,"keywords":["间隔重复","长期记忆","检索练习","Anki","遗忘曲线"],"summary":"我想介绍的这个记忆方法不算独特，只不过容易操作和坚持，也有一定的理论依据。 首先，想要记得久，复习是逃不开的。如何花少量时间达到最好的复习效果，以维持长期记忆？ 间隔重复 是一个科学的解决办法。 理论我不多说，看我写的这篇文章： Study smarter, NOT longer. 你需要间隔重复！ 另外，为了使自己每次能够记…","question_detail_html":"<p>每个人的方法不一样，到底怎么记忆才最适合自己最有效率。</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/355112164/answer/917498405","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"bytWYb62\">我想介绍的这个记忆方法不算独特，只不过容易操作和坚持，也有一定的理论依据。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"MJKaQqOm\">首先，想要记得久，复习是逃不开的。如何花少量时间达到最好的复习效果，以维持长期记忆？<b>间隔重复</b>是一个科学的解决办法。</p><p data-pid=\"GwlP0DWM\">理论我不多说，看我写的这篇文章：<a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"57020308\" href=\"#/post/57020308\">Study smarter, NOT longer. 你需要间隔重复！</a> </p><p data-pid=\"XMhxKOO2\">另外，为了使自己每次能够记得更牢，合理运用<b>测试效应</b>能够有很明显的帮助。</p><p data-pid=\"xULW663K\">理论介绍：<a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"57113246\" href=\"#/post/57113246\">测试效应——什么？考试有助于我的学习？</a></p><hr/><p data-pid=\"cTov39dm\">然后就是具体的方法介绍，我推荐使用 Anki 来辅助运用这个方法：</p><p data-pid=\"2a0EQNwj\">基于间隔重复的卡片记忆法</p><p data-pid=\"5CDVljcc\">核心：间隔重复、卡片记忆</p><p data-pid=\"6Gd8zm6t\">间隔重复由 Anki 本身自带的算法进行安排，换句话说，Anki 在我们每次复习结束时，会根据我们的复习情况<b>自动安排</b>下一次<b>复习时间</b>，如下图</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a63a21c97a255f91863f205efca7e01e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-fab1149f9d7737128e700929dba7fa60\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-8ca8cdfd7ffc50a2ce2a065654381a1e_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1058\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a63a21c97a255f91863f205efca7e01e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-fab1149f9d7737128e700929dba7fa60\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-8ca8cdfd7ffc50a2ce2a065654381a1e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1058\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"PMVdw1li\">卡片记忆则是需要我们将记忆内容做成卡片的形式</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-7d0cc40291e21783705fd5f958ec476f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-4cc8539e543f85278dffc26577660caa\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7b4329bed53a1e45e49a0e76f7e86de0_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1080\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-7d0cc40291e21783705fd5f958ec476f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-4cc8539e543f85278dffc26577660caa\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-7b4329bed53a1e45e49a0e76f7e86de0_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1080\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"-cKY7AKe\">然后 Anki 会先给我们看卡片的正面，让我们自行回忆，再点击显示答案</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9eebc9449419d20e4d2fc21c81a42e5c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-857b7cf5c4f97d7264ba7500d7684da0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-e6d233fe5219108c33152ab3e8e316e7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1080\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9eebc9449419d20e4d2fc21c81a42e5c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-857b7cf5c4f97d7264ba7500d7684da0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-e6d233fe5219108c33152ab3e8e316e7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1080\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"UYm7CrsK\">然后给我们卡片背面用于对照，选择符合自己本次复习的评价。Anki 会根据不同评价和卡片难度，对复习间隔和卡片难度进行调整。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"zue19MpR\">Anki 支持 windows、mac、linux、安卓、苹果等常见设备，并且可以多端同步，走到哪学到哪。</p><p data-pid=\"PrTBsH9k\">为了帮到有缘人，我写了一份快速上手教程：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2e8a109841199b0a18e70ae7bd16ea66_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"535\" data-image-width=\"1220\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/61564332\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：B 站 Ankidroid 视频教程与电子书(全平台教程)快速通道</a><p></p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"57020308","title":"【理论】Study smarter, NOT longer. 你需要间隔重复！","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":135,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"57113246","title":"【理论】测试效应——什么？考试有助于我的学习？","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":105,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"46855765","title":"使用Anki准备大型考试的设置","author":"Anki","votes":41,"minutes":7,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"46533104","title":"疑问:Anki 没有向我展示我的所有卡片！","author":"Anki","votes":12,"minutes":11,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"46856037","title":"我要去度假。我可以暂停复习程序吗？","author":"Anki","votes":16,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"38306259","title":"简单常见记忆误区解惑","author":"SuperMemo","votes":29,"minutes":6,"reason":"延伸深读 · SuperMemo"},{"id":"677540148","title":"一些创新洞察依赖于长期记忆","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":19,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"1005545481","title":"有哪些实用学习的APP可以推荐一下？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":66,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 66 赞同"},{"id":"749742933","title":"高三应该如何将三轮复习的效率最大化？理科？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":57,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 57 赞同"},{"id":"773275384","title":"有什么好的学习方法能让高三一年提高二百多分？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":28,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 28 赞同"},{"id":"1024915739","title":"有没有什么好用的手机学习软件？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":17,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 17 赞同"},{"id":"1882739659","title":"Anki 怎么用高效？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":241,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 241 赞同"}]}